  "notes": "Notification texts are verbatim from the spec (note the lower-case \"(pdf)\"/\"(csv)\" in the failure messages vs the upper-case success ones). MERGED 2026-07-28 (user-authorized consolidation, MERGE-PLAN G-IV-EXPTOAST): absorbed IV-EXP-08. Members retired locally + deleted from TestRail; bodies kept in cases/ marked Retired.",
